      "urn": "urn:cts:copticLit:proclus.homily13.budge",
      "dialect": "sahidic"
    },
    {
      "coptic": "**ⲡⲉⲧⲙⲓϣⲉ **ⲙⲛ**ⲛⲉⲑⲏⲣⲓⲟⲛ** ⲛⲟⲩⲙⲛⲧϫⲱⲱⲣⲉ ⲁⲛ ⲡⲉ · ⲛⲧϩⲉ ⲙⲡⲉⲧⲙⲓϣⲉ ⲙⲛⲙⲡⲁⲑⲟⲥ ·",
      "english": "He who fighteth with wild beasts is not as valiant as the man who fighteth against passion.",
